# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

Mailpit is a sink. Its whole content is the mail that arrives at runtime, and a
pre-seeded inbox would be indistinguishable from a real message and actively
misleading in a test. MP_DATABASE points into the mailpit-data volume, which is
the entirety of this Module state.
